/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  postDict -- the compressor's DETAILED DESIGN (DEV.md 4c C440).

  `design {}` switches the power-only sizing to the staged design.  Everything
  it needs that is not declared here is READ FROM THE SOURCE and announced
  with its page (Brown 2005): the machine from the application chart (Fig 1-2,
  p.3), the polytropic efficiency 0.75 and the 1 % mechanical loss of a
  centrifugal estimate (p.196, p.199), the 2 % / 2 psi intercooler pressure drop
  (p.200), the motor at 110 % of the greatest power (p.307).

  DECLARED, because the source's limit does not know this process:
    maxDischargeT 450 K   the plant's own limit on the hot gas after a stage
                          (the book's 475 F is "arbitrary", p.197); 450 K is
                          what this teaching case asks, so the design needs three
                          sections where the book's limit would need two.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
sizing
{
    units
    (
        { unitName compressor1;  type compressor;  material SS316;
          designRules
          {
              pressureDesign 17.0;
              design { maxDischargeT 450.0 K; }
          } }
    );
}
